<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs off $0.75-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs off $0.75-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts</p>
<p>were $0.75 to $1.00 lower. Trading was slow. Top $55.25 per</p>
<p>cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs    54.50-55.00, 24 head 55.25</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.50/$1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-400 lbs   47.00</p>
<p>		   400-500 lbs   47.50-49.00</p>
<p>		   500-650 lbs   50.00-52.00</p>
</text>
